{"job_id":"F-6f1b4cff0c4ebaa7e488","family_id":"F-6f1b4cff0c4ebaa7e488","title":"혼인신고특례법","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001173-91380-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":7,"target_id":"3dacb9d229692c536c42b472f8a6c82406c334316ec19a75ca995abb7ff8afaa","source_hash":"4fedde7cb1d0d3cc5d667aeadaf06d0331b6d2971a5c0e86e7349c976c18520d","text":"婚姻登记特别法"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001173-91380-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":129,"target_id":"690d7a5f4efeff90e02e27e0cc10e2660b8283c577623db7170be036099bd18e","source_hash":"cb47c24cea1166af96a62d676c30bd70e4e5c9ca7f68c066fabe960936a215c7","text":"第一条（目的）本法的目的是规定，对于婚姻当事人之一因在战争或紧急情况下参加战斗，或者因履行战斗义务而死亡，而未登记婚姻的情况，应作特别规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001173-91380-ko","scope":"BODY","start":129,"end":221,"target_id":"1033e5cfd4526acd10886671fac862c8243d93e6b9e672a4b67c366a0dfa26de","source_hash":"985d47ba20d9a4e7ce7834d7036e179686d93625af766185680ad92b54f6e718","text":"第二条（婚姻申报）如果负有婚姻申报义务的一方因第一条规定的理由死亡，则幸存的一方在获得家庭法院的确认后，可以单方面申报婚姻。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001173-91380-ko","scope":"BODY","start":221,"end":281,"target_id":"bf9f09641ab519a1d01ba6587091f439a187b9b1ee7369fd9493411f3ca4ffce","source_hash":"5ba7f432aaf8fbf00ba6ea5f25e53511a9ddc802b2ed5b40cea96cf168fcf111","text":"第三条（确认判决的管辖权） 死者最后住所地的家庭法院对第二条规定的确认具有管辖权。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001173-91380-ko","scope":"BODY","start":281,"end":351,"target_id":"ef6423d09cbf2419cf19fd39c13115e460729660dc3f4baa548d66ce37bd38d1","source_hash":"b57361cb3e52a728a7afc9c78f1520fcf76a6f65f5f1173041bdd090ced0d417","text":"第四条（报告的效力）如果根据第二条作出了报告，则该报告应视为在负有报告义务的任何一方死亡时作出。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001173-91380-ko","scope":"BODY","start":351,"end":411,"target_id":"597f0b67a6c753778fc0c538d7cd9670afe6a17f38a54406151dd55b712230a7","source_hash":"c92e9ee5a6115527e8943a817bf71ea7d7e605d855c716073d804b04ec187a99","text":"第五条（适用范围）根据第一条规定，有关战斗或履行战斗公务的事项，由总统令规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001173-91380-ko","scope":"BODY","start":411,"end":456,"target_id":"70e22a490a0df96a6baa890e3c344430ec603d18d619d0bbb3c393e57ffbf72f","source_hash":"46d96161868b3402362931f0cdb5df505df0ce14cc9067484f10f2cbb7794959","text":"补充条款 <第2067号条款，1968年12月31日>\n\n本法自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001173-91380-ko","scope":"BODY","start":456,"end":497,"target_id":"efad194a4be662874e219f07607760b5b8366e5f84b41c0c06af9b45bbc5111d","source_hash":"c925784f8cb19046715350bfcce06cbdcef3e19d5306c62571d4127749c4963e","text":"补充规定 <第9365号，2009年1月30日>\n\n本法自颁布之日起生效。"},{"id":"B2-zh-00001","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005659-187752-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":10,"target_id":"6aa104ca1d9aa0b0e80677e11ca54b9a864c9a4fbe4e8736973d83bab7bc4c17","source_hash":"198730d68cbce625435240e48d76b0eb4126faf667613c5060a39ed71ecd862c","text":"关于婚姻登记特殊案件法的执行令"},{"id":"B2-zh-00002","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005659-187752-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":92,"target_id":"a429b788c25bd6f4bce83dfee1b1fdd7630c086f5d863c3be270c1f6912d70ff","source_hash":"59bd045cef05672f98432a2b0fc881e8d7a9ee5274cc8d317ce2ab04abc419b6","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是规定根据《婚姻登记特别案件法》（以下简称“该法”）第五条的规定，有关履行战斗公务或进行战斗的事项的范围。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00003","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005659-187752-ko","scope":"BODY","start":92,"end":294,"target_id":"225af972e1e67d36439961811302efcaccf8475bead67890340da7ad7ed2e7c1","source_hash":"cb2c091733815368ff9692f9075260904920fef047b055e0652ec769df2a075e","text":"第二条（战斗等概念）本法第一条所称“从事战斗或者为战斗而履行公共职责”是指士兵、军属、警察、预备役人员或者被征召从事战时劳动的人员实施下列各项行为的情况。<2016年11月29日修订>\n1. 根据作战命令对敌方或反国家组织开展作战活动\n2. 镇压武装暴乱的作战行动\n3. 支持前述 2 中规定的法案的法案\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00004","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005659-187752-ko","scope":"BODY","start":294,"end":345,"target_id":"468a13514f1dc8250d28cce0b221adc36488e4b355ab6600e15f75d06c2380a0","source_hash":"d8b177f439413b3245d86b61d1ffa3f6bb91119ae93a631048701b35d0419944","text":"补充条款 <第3952号，1969年5月30日>\n\n本法令自1968年12月31日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00005","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005659-187752-ko","scope":"BODY","start":345,"end":380,"target_id":"decc7f3eef666bef01d36b5a2adc586441a37a104913f67b569546ae53c93b13","source_hash":"82b6a4072b6b57270ca56f300ab1861c2f6c65a75bd900d8c12729289603aa1e","text":"附录（预备役部队法实施令）<第27619号，2016年11月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00006","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005659-187752-ko","scope":"BODY","start":380,"end":417,"target_id":"f50e8a36d5542a740ba7d7505f85cfd5184d70c20f850b0c69d605e4fa45f7aa","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00007","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005659-187752-ko","scope":"BODY","start":417,"end":425,"target_id":"10722ed06f4e9c21cfc50d3d654446597a3f99d05c0245ffc4e1ec6bb5e0ddb8","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00008","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005659-187752-ko","scope":"BODY","start":425,"end":491,"target_id":"e6a1fa50d25ad55f59e114d2db9667457cc5d177a58f02a15e3928b73bab0e33","source_hash":"9f991e951c43d0d9631fa963619dc8488d9f3e50a295c3292d2cac7adf6ba9f5","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至<16>款省略\n\n  <17>《婚姻登记特别案件法》实施细则部分内容修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00009","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005659-187752-ko","scope":"BODY","start":491,"end":531,"target_id":"413bc4005afdfeee9cade5d6414638d488320d7ceb8c26206e8b1bcd22c021a7","source_hash":"711de2db26839a69e6ecce455a55b5dc96ab4be32820c2a22e321f1f1f76bce8","text":"  除第2条各款外，“地方后备部队”应改为“后备部队”。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00010","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005659-187752-ko","scope":"BODY","start":531,"end":537,"target_id":"7c8ef3b997e6d08c313f91e2a2552875b49833a649137cd2d76adb49b389237f","source_hash":"558c6d17486d0d6657212a87561377425c0a8eb8bdfabed29d681808202e17af","text":"第 4 条省略"}]}